WEBVTT

00:15.960 --> 00:22.680
On dark, cold nights when my tears run dry

00:22.680 --> 00:29.460
Solitude gnaws at my heart as I carry this burden alone

00:29.460 --> 00:36.380
It just makes no sense, for there's no end in sight

00:36.380 --> 00:42.920
Yet we must overcome our flaws to move on

00:43.640 --> 00:49.500
So we solemnly swear a vow

00:50.460 --> 00:57.940
Push ahead into the break of a new dawn

00:57.940 --> 01:04.460
We are believers, each with a light deep within

01:04.460 --> 01:11.700
Never stop forging ahead, keep that faith burning bright

01:11.700 --> 01:18.200
Although perils abound as we fight for tomorrow

01:18.200 --> 01:25.600
Our banner of hope lights the way through the night
